Notification System

Functional requirement

1. Support multiple delivery channel (email, SMS, push notification, in app)
2. Create, update, manage notification template with dynamic content
3. Allow users to configure notification preferences per channel and type
4. Support immediate and scheduled notification delivery
5. track delivery status

Non Functional Requirement

1. Scale : 1M+ notifications/min
2. CAP availability >> consistency
3. Latency <5-10s (for promo delay fine -> for otp should be realtime)


--------------------------------------------------------------

Core Entity

1. User + client
2. Notification preference
3. Notification content 
4. Template
5. delivery status

--------------------------------------------------------------

API Design

- POST api/v1/notifications (templateId, recipientId, variables, channels)
- GET api/v1/notifications/{notificationId}/status

Template Design

- POST api/v1/templates
- GET api/v1/templates/{templateId}/{version}

User preference

- PUT api/v1/preferences

